  events:
  - id: oskar_reveal
    title: THE HAND IN THE VENT
    body: He shows nobody. The vent shows everyone. The grate is bent outward in
      a shape with five points and one extra. He does not explain. The log has a
      field for this. Nobody fills it.
    causeLine: The new engineer has six fingers.
    conditions:
    - kind: 0
      tag: 9
      role: 0
      flag: 
      stat: 0
      value: 0
    minTurn: 0
    maxTurn: 99
    priority: 0
    <weight>k__BackingField: 10
    once: 1
    choices:
    - label: KEEP HIM QUIET
      result: The log stays blank. He stays. The vent stays warm.
      survival: 0
      science: 1
      morale: -1
      setFlag: oskar_vented
      requirements: []
      lockHint: 
      removal:
        selector: 0
        cardId: 
        tag: 0
        role: 0
    - label: PUT HIM OUT
      result: The airlock cycles. The shape in the grate is still there.
      survival: 1
      science: 0
      morale: -2
      setFlag: 
      requirements: []
      lockHint: 
      removal:
        selector: 1
        cardId: oskar_engineer
        tag: 0
        role: 0
  - id: tamsin_orders
    title: ORDERS FROM THE BRIDGE
    body: Three pages. Rationing, watch rotation, a line about the child. She has
      signed them. She has not asked anyone. The pen is still in her hand when you
      find her.
    causeLine: The soldier has been writing orders.
    conditions:
    - kind: 1
      tag: 0
      role: 2
      flag: 
      stat: 0
      value: 0
    minTurn: 0
    maxTurn: 99
    priority: 0
    <weight>k__BackingField: 10
    once: 1
    choices:
    - label: SIGN THEM
      result: The orders stand. The crew obeys. Nobody looks at her.
      survival: 1
      science: 0
      morale: 1
      setFlag: tamsin_oath
      requirements: []
      lockHint: 
      removal:
        selector: 0
        cardId: 
        tag: 0
        role: 0
    - label: BURN THEM
      result: The paper curls. She watches it. She does not argue.
      survival: 0
      science: 0
      morale: -1
      setFlag: 
      requirements: []
      lockHint: 
      removal:
        selector: 0
        cardId: 
        tag: 0
        role: 0
  - id: essa_sings
    title: SOMETHING IN THE DUCT
    body: The duct is not a person. The duct answers anyway. The sound is not a child's
      sound. She says it is a friend. She says it has been there since the burn.
    causeLine: The child has been singing to the vent.
    conditions:
    - kind: 0
      tag: 3
      role: 0
      flag: 
      stat: 0
      value: 0
    minTurn: 0
    maxTurn: 99
    priority: 0
    <weight>k__BackingField: 10
    once: 1
    choices:
    - label: LET HER SING
      result: The vent hums back. The crew sleeps better. Nobody asks why.
      survival: 0
      science: 0
      morale: 2
      setFlag: essa_kept
      requirements: []
      lockHint: 
      removal:
        selector: 0
        cardId: 
        tag: 0
        role: 0
    - label: SEAL THE DUCT
      result: The grate goes quiet. She does not sing again.
      survival: -1
      science: 0
      morale: -1
      setFlag: 
      requirements: []
      lockHint: 
      removal:
        selector: 0
        cardId: 
        tag: 0
        role: 0
  - id: corwin_cough
    title: THE COUGH
    body: It is a dry cough. He says it is the dust. The dust has been in the air
      since the burn. Nobody else is coughing. He says that means nothing. He is
      probably right.
    causeLine: The new hand coughs in the corridor.
    conditions:
    - kind: 0
      tag: 7
      role: 0
      flag: 
      stat: 0
      value: 0
    minTurn: 0
    maxTurn: 99
    priority: 0
    <weight>k__BackingField: 10
    once: 1
    choices:
    - label: LOG IT AS ALLERGY
      result: The log says allergy. He keeps working. The cough keeps going.
      survival: 0
      science: 1
      morale: -1
      setFlag: cough_hidden
      requirements: []
      lockHint: 
      removal:
        selector: 0
        cardId: 
        tag: 0
        role: 0
    - label: SEND HIM TO BUNK
      result: He goes. The work slows. The corridor is quiet.
      survival: -1
      science: -1
      morale: 1
      setFlag: 
      requirements: []
      lockHint: 
      removal:
        selector: 0
        cardId: 
        tag: 0
        role: 0
  - id: yusuf_hands
    title: SIX FINGERS
    body: It is on the left hand. It is not a thumb. He uses it to reach a panel
      nobody else can reach. The panel works better now. The log has no field for
      the finger.
    causeLine: The new engineer has an extra finger.
    conditions:
    - kind: 0
      tag: 9
      role: 0
      flag: 
      stat: 0
      value: 0
    minTurn: 0
    maxTurn: 99
    priority: 0
    <weight>k__BackingField: 10
    once: 1
    choices:
    - label: KEEP HIM
      result: The panel stays fixed. The finger stays unlogged. The crew adjusts.
      survival: 0
      science: 1
      morale: -1
      setFlag: yusuf_spared
      requirements: []
      lockHint: 
      removal:
        selector: 0
        cardId: 
        tag: 0
        role: 0
    - label: LOG THE ANOMALY
      result: The log records it. The crew reads the log. The panel breaks again.
      survival: 1
      science: 0
      morale: -2
      setFlag: 
      requirements: []
      lockHint: 
      removal:
        selector: 0
        cardId: 
        tag: 0
        role: 0
  - id: fever_breaks
    title: THE FEVER BREAKS
    body: He has been quiet since the second day. Now the bunk is quiet in a different
      way. The others have already decided what to do about it. They are waiting
      for you to say it out loud.
    causeLine: The sick man stops answering.
    conditions:
    - kind: 0
      tag: 7
      role: 0
      flag: 
      stat: 0
      value: 0
    minTurn: 2
    maxTurn: 99
    priority: 0
    <weight>k__BackingField: 10
    once: 1
    choices:
    - label: CALL THE MEDIC
      result: She works for an hour. He breathes. Nobody thanks her.
      survival: 1
      science: 0
      morale: 1
      setFlag: 
      requirements:
      - kind: 0
        tag: 5
        role: 0
        flag: 
        stat: 0
        value: 0
      lockHint: NO MEDIC ON BOARD
      removal:
        selector: 0
        cardId: 
        tag: 0
        role: 0
    - label: SEAL THE BUNK
      result: The door closes. The log records a name and nothing else.
      survival: 0
      science: 0
      morale: -2
      setFlag: bunk_sealed
      requirements: []
      lockHint: 
      removal:
        selector: 2
        cardId: 
        tag: 7
